Changes in version 1.7.2 (2022-02-17)
+ assay_name argument changed to assay.type

Changes in version 0.99.0 (2021-03-19)
+ Submitted to Bioconductor

Changes in version 1.1.x
+ Added plotAbundanceDensity (2021-06-23)

Changes in version 1.3.x
+ Bugfix for plotting functions to support sparseMatrix and other assay types (2021-12-31)
+ Replaced abund_values with assay_name

Changes in version 1.5.x
+ plot*Tree & *TreeData: Add support for multiple trees
+ plot*Tree layout bugfix

Changes in version 1.7.x
+ Fixed plotGraph* that was broked due changes in dependencies

Changes in version 1.9.x
+ Updated plotDMN to work with newest mia version
+ Added plotCCA and plotRDA functions

Changes in version 1.11.x
+ replace addTaxonomyTree with addHierarchyTree after renaming in mia package

Changes in version 1.13.x
+ plot*Tree: bugfix, ununique nodes
+ Added confidence.level parameter to plotCCA
+ add plotNMDS to miaViz (plotNMDS deprecated in mia)
+ Added getNeatOrder function
+ plotAbundance: enable plotting without agglomeration
+ Change parameter naming convention from parameter_name to parameter.name
+ Added plotLoadings function

Changes in version 1.15.x
+ plotAbundance: Improved visualization of sample metadata
+ plotScree: Method for creating scree plots
+ plotRDA: Now it is possible to add only specified vectors
+ plotMediation: Method to visualise results of mediation analysis
+ plotRDA: Fix error that occurred when variable names were similar
+ Added plotHistogram
+ Added plotBarplot

Changes in version 1.17.x
+ Improve *Histogram and *Barplot by adding options for filling and facetting (2025-04-24)
+ Added plotBoxplot function (2025-04-27)
+ plotSeries: Improve by adding functionality for sample groups (2025-04-28)

Changes in version 1.19.x
+ plotRDA: Now plotting works with interaction term (2025-11-09)
+ plotBoxplot: Added option to add p-values (2026-01-07)

Changes in version 1.21.x
+ Added plotOrdination and plotJointRPCA (2026-08-04)
+ Added plotHeatmap (2026-08-10)
+ Added multimedia_data_demo example datasets (se_relative, tse_relative, tse_pathway) (2026-09-01)
+ plotBoxplot: paired lines follow the time order with more than two time points (1.21.8, 2026-11-02)
+ plotBoxplot, fix typo in argument name: add.chance -> add.change (1.21.10, 2026-11-03)
+ Added plotJointRPCACovariance, plotJointRPCAExplainedVariance and plotJointRPCANetwork (1.21.12, 2026-11-07)
+ Added plotDissimilarity (1.21.13, 2026-11-07)
+ Added getHeatmapOrder for sorting heatmaps; plotHeatmap and plotDissimilarity gain sort.method; getNeatOrder is deprecated (1.21.14, 2026-11-09)
+ Plots use the palette set with the ggplot2.discrete.colour or ggplot2.discrete.fill option, if it has enough colours, e.g. for colour-blind-friendly figures (1.21.15, 2026-11-17)
+ Require mia (>= 1.21.31) for subsetBy(), used in examples and tests; until it is available from Bioconductor devel, mia is installed from GitHub (Remotes) (1.21.17, 2026-11-20)
+ plotForest: confidence intervals from 'err.var' use the degrees of freedom given with the new 'df.var' or 'df' arguments; previously the number of columns of the results table was used. Without them, the normal distribution is used with a warning (1.21.18, 2026-11-20)
+ The default discrete palette is the colour-blind-friendly Okabe-Ito palette (up to 8 groups) instead of Tableau; viridis is used for more groups (1.21.19, 2026-11-20)
+ plotRowTree, plotColTree: Added heatmap.by option for showing per-taxon values as a heatmap or rings next to the tree tips (1.21.20, 2026-11-20)
+ Removed the temporary Remotes entry for mia, as Bioconductor devel now has mia >= 1.21.31 (1.21.21, 2026-11-20)
+ plotOrdination: aspect.ratio = "eigen" now scales the panel by the explained variance of the plotted components (it previously had no effect); aspect.ratio is documented in place of the non-existent panel.by.eigen (1.21.22, 2026-11-20)
+ Readable plot defaults (OMA#965): plotHeatmap draws column labels vertically; plotOrdination axis titles use the ordination method and component number ("MDS1" for "MDS_bray") when the components have no names; plotLoadings labels unnamed components "Component 1", ..., shows components in their original order (PC2 before PC10), titles the value axis "Loading", and omits the sign legend when all loadings have the same sign; plotOrdination and plotBoxplot use size.by as the title of the size legend (1.21.23, 2026-11-20)
+ plotHeatmap, plotDissimilarity: labs(fill = ...) now overrides the legend title (#259) (2026-11-20)
+ plotBoxplot: works when a variable is named "x", "y" or "df"; variable names that clash with internal columns (e.g. "x_point") give an error instead of being silently overwritten (#239) (2026-11-20)
+ plotRDA, plotCCA: samples excluded from the ordination (e.g. na.action = na.exclude) are not plotted, so they no longer add an empty NA entry to the legends (#260) (2026-11-20)
+ plotBoxplot: outlier.size, outlier.colour, outlier.alpha and outlier.shape style the boxplot outliers shown with add.points = FALSE (#227) (2026-11-20)
+ plotMediation: with layout = "forest", reduced-dimension mediators (e.g. PCA1, PCA2, ..., PCA10) are faceted in the order of components instead of the order of significance (2026-11-21)
